ementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79c252b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"79c252b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"528\" height=\"361\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/15-septiembre.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-855\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/15-septiembre.jpg 528w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/15-septiembre-300x205.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 528px) 100vw, 528px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9a2a11b\" data-id=\"9a2a11b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4725865d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4725865d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>SAP Business One allows the integration of other departments of the company, so that logistics and merchandise delivery personnel can know the status of a product either by batch, date, plant, warehouse, etc.<\/p><p>Emerson Rush&#8217;s <span style=\"color: #333333;\"><a style=\"color: #333333;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/sap-canada\/\"><strong>SAP Canada<\/strong><\/a><\/span> experts are the right professionals to implement ERP modules for your business. With our advice you will be able to reinforce planning, analysis and collaboration capacities in the supply chain and logistics, so tha